{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_hut_2","model_identifier":"goblin_hut_2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_hut_2\n\nGoblin hut, variant 2: a crooked hut of sticks, patched hides and scavenged planks under a sagging, lopsided roof. Hostile (no team colour).\n\n- Footprint: 5 x 5 columns (80 x 80 units, 2.25 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -49..48, y 0..135, z -36..28 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 18, construction_0 18, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 22 (40 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 130 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `goblin_hut_2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `goblin_hut_2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_goblin_hut_2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -38)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Walls and roof slabs are slightly rotated on purpose (crooked); everything else is axis-aligned.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,0.0,-28.0],"to":[40.0,2.0,28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,293.0,80.0,295.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,295.0,56.0,297.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,293.0,80.0,295.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,295.0,56.0,297.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[114.0,93.0,194.0,149.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[114.0,93.0,194.0,149.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e769816f-a72d-59d4-b196-53568eede5c8"},{"name":"wall_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-38.0,2.0,-26.0],"to":[38.0,86.3414,-23.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,2,-26.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,93.6586,76.0,178.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[76.0,93.6586,79.0,178.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,93.6586,76.0,178.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[76.0,93.6586,79.0,178.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[88.0,280.0,164.0,283.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[88.0,280.0,164.0,283.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e50fba4b-8084-5bb1-b343-e9eee291a9dd","rotation":[0,0,-0.8545]},{"name":"wall_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-38.0,2.0,23.0],"to":[38.0,88.3327,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,2,23.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[108.0,0.6673,184.0,87.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[184.0,0.6673,187.0,87.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[108.0,0.6673,184.0,87.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[184.0,0.6673,187.0,87.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[164.0,280.0,240.0,283.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[164.0,280.0,240.0,283.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a2079c8f-68db-5b81-9f91-