:"43fc6451-e026-5234-8834-0070e838458e","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"goblin_hut_2.png","name":"goblin_hut_2.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":256,"height":512,"uv_width":256,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"e9187486-8f16-5d86-ba6d-553403d8c645","relative_path":"goblin_hut_2.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# goblin_hut_2\n\nGoblin hut, variant 2: a crooked hut of sticks, patched hides and scavenged planks under a sagging, lopsided roof. Hostile (no team colour).\n\n- Footprint: 5 x 5 columns (80 x 80 units, 2.25 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -49..48, y 0..135, z -36..28 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 18, construction_0 18, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 22 (40 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 130 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `goblin_hut_2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `goblin_hut_2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_goblin_hut_2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -38)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Walls and roof slabs are slightly rotated on purpose (crooked); everything else is axis-aligned.\n"}